  "id": "card-writes-local",
  "title": "updateCard, createCard and deleteCard are answered on the device (C-31, rule L-10)",
  "covers": [
    "cards.single_writes_local"
  ],
  "narrative": [
    "One kana-only word with its meaning card, and one extra preset. These three operations emit the ops bulkCards emits; before C-31 the shell forwarded them.",
    "Steps 0-3: updateCard mints one op per property present: suspend; flag and preset in one call; unsuspend and bury; unbury. Each answer is the card after the change.",
    "Step 4: an empty body is 422.",
    "Steps 5-7: createCard for the listening kind is 201; the same id again, and the same (note, kind) without an id, are 200 with the same card and mint nothing.",
    "Steps 8-9: a kind the note type does not have, and the retired reading kind (cards.reading_enabled is not set), are 422 at /kind.",
    "Steps 10-12: deleteCard is 204, the card then answers 410, a second delete is 204 and mints nothing.",
    "Step 13: the card list holds the listening card only."
  ],
